<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported five ships loading, 11 waiting and four due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Thursday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load on the West Coast was 14 days. Two ships loaded in Thunder Bay and five were due. One ship loaded on the East Coast, one waited and 11 were due.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 4	     7</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   1	     4</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
